{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astrochibbi is a fast paced arena survivor where your tiny astro faces endless swarms in chaotic bullet hell battles. Survive as long as you can, grow absurdly powerful, and see how far your skills and builds can take you each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/02796938aede17a2e2dbb38eeb91a183.poster.avif?t=1772768976\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/02796938aede17a2e2dbb38eeb91a183.webm?t=1772768976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/02796938aede17a2e2dbb38eeb91a183.mp4?t=1772768976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle increasingly difficult swarms of monsters that flood the arena from every direction. Each wave ramps up the pressure, testing your movement, positioning, and survival instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/abd79d808c4ab1ade6621171c62f93fe.poster.avif?t=1772768976\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/abd79d808c4ab1ade6621171c62f93fe.webm?t=1772768976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/abd79d808c4ab1ade6621171c62f93fe.mp4?t=1772768976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated enemies give you Bits that you can use to become stronger. Every reward helps you grow more powerful for upcoming battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/301d494a9898e6fc463af848c7930f1d.poster.avif?t=1772768976\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/301d494a9898e6fc463af848c7930f1d.webm?t=1772768976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/301d494a9898e6fc463af848c7930f1d.mp4?t=1772768976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete waves to earn free upgrades that shape your build and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend collected Bits in the shop to stack bonuses, strengthen weapons, and push your character beyond the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/a4200cba888dedb0048cce61f182b177.poster.avif?t=1772768976\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/a4200cba888dedb0048cce61f182b177.webm?t=1772768976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/a4200cba888dedb0048cce61f182b177.mp4?t=1772768976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves grow tougher over time, forcing you to adapt and optimize your upgrades to stay alive. Smart decisions and powerful synergies are the key to lasting as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepage